### MITPass Phase 1 demo requests, sent through the gateway.
### Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ's HTTP client (click "Send Request"),
### or copy them into Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
### The expected status is in each request's title.

@gw = http://localhost:8080

### 200 Categories (reference data)
GET {{gw}}/api/categories

### 200 Venues
GET {{gw}}/api/venues

### 200 Search: TechFest events in November (dates are campus days, Asia/Kolkata)
GET {{gw}}/api/events?q=hack&category=TECHNICAL&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### 200 Search: everything, newest first, 3 per page
GET {{gw}}/api/events?sort=startsAt,desc&size=3

### 201 Create an event with two sessions (Location header points at the gateway)
POST {{gw}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "HACKNITE26",
  "title": "HackNite: 12-hour Build Sprint",
  "description": "Overnight build sprint for second-year students.",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "venueId": 3,
  "department": "CSE",
  "capacity": 80,
  "startsAt": "2026-11-28T12:30:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-29T00:30:00Z",
  "registrationOpensAt": "2026-11-01T03:30:00Z",
  "registrationClosesAt": "2026-11-27T12:30:00Z",
  "sessions": [
    {"title": "Build", "startsAt": "2026-11-28T12:30:00Z", "endsAt": "2026-11-28T21:30:00Z"},
    {"title": "Demos", "startsAt": "2026-11-28T21:30:00Z", "endsAt": "2026-11-29T00:30:00Z"}
  ]
}

### 200 Find it again
GET {{gw}}/api/events?q=hacknite

### 409 Same code again (conflict)
POST {{gw}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "HACKNITE26", "title": "Duplicate", "categoryId": 1, "venueId": 3, "capacity": 10,
  "startsAt": "2026-12-28T12:30:00Z", "endsAt": "2026-12-28T14:30:00Z"
}

### 400 Invalid payload: structured ProblemDetail with errors[] (exit criterion 4)
POST {{gw}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "bad code",
  "title": "",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "venueId": 3,
  "capacity": 0,
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-01T09:00:00Z"
}

### 422 Capacity larger than the venue (Innovation Centre Lab holds 120)
POST {{gw}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "TOOBIG26", "title": "Too big for the lab", "categoryId": 1, "venueId": 3, "capacity": 500,
  "startsAt": "2026-12-28T12:30:00Z", "endsAt": "2026-12-28T14:30:00Z"
}

### 404 Unknown event
GET {{gw}}/api/events/999999

### 400 Unknown sort property
GET {{gw}}/api/events?sort=bogus

### 409 Seeded TECHFEST26 is not DRAFT, so it can't be deleted (use its id from the search above; 1 on a fresh DB)
DELETE {{gw}}/api/events/1
